{
  "esm": "1.3.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "transport_flux_divergence_cell",
    "description": "Scalar atom of the B-grid conservative flux-form cell divergence of the layered transport rule transport_flux_divergence_layered: div_cell = (F_e(i,j) - F_e(i-1,j) + F_n(i,j) - F_n(i,j-1)) / tarea(i,j), assembled from the four edge-flux atoms transport_flux_e/n bound to the ten cell/edge values of the cell and its west/south neighbors (the Fortran mass update mm = mm - (mflxe(i,j) - mflxe(i-1,j) + mflxn(i,j) - mflxn(i,j-1))*tarear, ice_transport_remap.F90:3586-3590). Params: the east-edge values (cL, cR, uS, uN, HTE), the west-edge values (cLm, cRm, uSm, uNm, HTEm) = the east-edge values of cell (i-1,j), the north-edge values (cS, cN, vW, vE, HTN), the south-edge values (cSm, cNm, vWm, vEm, HTNm) = the north-edge values of cell (i,j-1), and the cell area tarea. Pure combination algebra: no faq, no index sets of its own; the transport_flux_divergence_layered rule binds the 21 values from the surrounding cells and U points per boundary class (the layer index is passive: every c value carries the same layer subscript l, so the same edge fluxes/areas apply per layer).",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": ["esd:stencil", "family:cice_bgrid", "grid:cice_bgrid", "op:advection"],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Hunke, E. C., et al. (2023). CICE v6.3.22 documentation and user's guide (LA-UR-23-31851), the horizontal transport edge reconstruction."
      }
    ]
  },
  "expression_template_imports": [
    {
      "ref": "../stencils/transport_flux_e.esm"
    },
    {
      "ref": "../stencils/transport_flux_n.esm"
    }
  ],
  "expression_templates": {
    "transport_flux_divergence_cell": {
      "params": [
        "cL",
        "cR",
        "uS",
        "uN",
        "HTE",
        "cLm",
        "cRm",
        "uSm",
        "uNm",
        "HTEm",
        "cS",
        "cN",
        "vW",
        "vE",
        "HTN",
        "cSm",
        "cNm",
        "vWm",
        "vEm",
        "HTNm",
        "tarea"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "/",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "+",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "apply_expression_template",
                "args": [],
                "name": "transport_flux_e",
                "bindings": {
                  "cL": "cL",
                  "cR": "cR",
                  "uS": "uS",
                  "uN": "uN",
                  "HTE": "HTE"
                }
              },
              {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "apply_expression_template",
                    "args": [],
                    "name": "transport_flux_e",
                    "bindings": {
                      "cL": "cLm",
                      "cR": "cRm",
                      "uS": "uSm",
                      "uN": "uNm",
                      "HTE": "HTEm"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "apply_expression_template",
                "args": [],
                "name": "transport_flux_n",
                "bindings": {
                  "cS": "cS",
                  "cN": "cN",
                  "vW": "vW",
                  "vE": "vE",
                  "HTN": "HTN"
                }
              },
              {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "apply_expression_template",
                    "args": [],
                    "name": "transport_flux_n",
                    "bindings": {
                      "cS": "cSm",
                      "cN": "cNm",
                      "vW": "vWm",
                      "vE": "vEm",
                      "HTN": "HTNm"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "tarea"
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
